# Local Dashboard UI

Before editing files under `dashboard/`, read and follow [`dashboard/DESIGN.md`](dashboard/DESIGN.md). For stack/API, see [`dashboard/ARCHITECTURE.md`](dashboard/ARCHITECTURE.md).

## Required

- Preserve the established theme: colored Lucide kind icons, yellow folders/accents, green healthy connection status, semantic type colors.
- Catalog chrome: sticky Local/Cloud switcher above the scroll region; one active catalog tree.
- Show sidebar `vN` when `version !== null`.
- Keep WCAG AA muted-foreground contrast; do not use a11y as a reason to strip semantic color.

## Forbidden

- KindBadge T/V/S/R as the primary kind language (do not combine with Lucide icons).
- `+ Add catalog` buried inside the scrolling directory tree / stacked multi-root forest as default chrome.
- Silent visual redesigns or one-off themes that diverge from DESIGN.md.

If you propose a departure, state it explicitly and justify against DESIGN.md.
